CORE
main.c
--unwind 4 --rounds 3 --glucose
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Value narrowing: [0-9][0-9]* objects$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
x and y grow only when the two threads alternate, once per round: y is at
most 2 after round 1, 4 after round 2, 6 after round 3, and the links of each
round are narrowed to that. The violation needs y = 6 in the last round; a
round width that were too small would lose it.
